      "content": "hey so i just got back from a 14 hour flight from singapore to ny and im feeling kinda rough. my calf is hurting really sharp on one side and i'm having a hard time catching my breath... is it just like travel fatigue and dehydration or something? i'm super exhausted so i kinda just wanna sleep it off",
